! ---- CHECKS, read by tests/verify_mcp_page.py 107 ----------------
! Thirty symbols and no rows: a SYN deposits no storage word, so
! there is nothing for a !CHECK to look at.  Manufacturing one from
! the "+00000000" the BINARY OUTPUT column prints would be checking
! the printer, not the assembler.
! >>> TWO PAIRS SHARE AN ADDRESS BY DESIGN AND ARE NOT DUPLICATES:
! lines 6/7 (SCHNAV, SUNNAV) both at 010003.00 and lines 8/9
! (SIODI, SUNNAS) both at 010004.00, because lines 7 and 9 are
! "SYN,symbol" cards naming the line above.  THIRTY !SYM LINES,
! TWENTY-EIGHT DISTINCT LOCATIONS.  See convention (4).
!SYM   SIFERR   010001.00
!SYM   SOPCI    010002.00
!SYM   SCHNAV   010003.00
!SYM   SUNNAV   010003.00
!SYM   SIODI    010004.00
!SYM   SUNNAS   010004.00
!SYM   SPPTNG   010005.00
!SYM   S2BIG    010006.00
!SYM   SCWINV   010007.00
!SYM   SCCWAD   010010.00
!SYM   SFORBD   010011.00
!SYM   SFORMT   000412.00
!SYM   SNXOUT   000401.00
!SYM   SUSUPP   000402.00
!SYM   STMMI    000403.00
!SYM   SOAUD    000404.00
!SYM   SLABNG   000405.00
!SYM   SBR40    000406.00
!SYM   SPTOEX   000407.00
!SYM   SCOMER   000410.00
!SYM   SFIXP    000411.00
!SYM   SERCOD   001012.00
!SYM   SIOERR   003405.00
!SYM   SREJ     003406.00
!SYM   SQERR    003407.00
!SYM   SQ2BIG   003410.00
!SYM   SPQFUL   003411.00
!SYM   SIFAS    004012.00
!SYM   SEPGK    004001.00
!SYM   SASNER   004002.00
